
## 1. Core functionality

Your flow is:

```text
User enters text
      ↓
"SOS"
      ↓
Morse Encoder
      ↓
"... --- ..."
      ↓
Timing Engine
      ↓
Flashlight ON/OFF
      ↓
📱 Camera Flash
```

For example:

**SOS**

```text
S = ...
O = ---
S = ...
```

So the transmitted sequence becomes:

```text
... --- ...
```

---

## 2. Morse timing

Use the standard Morse timing:

| Signal                 | Duration |
| ---------------------- | -------: |
| Dot `.`                |   1 unit |
| Dash `-`               |  3 units |
| Gap inside a character |   1 unit |
| Gap between characters |  3 units |
| Gap between words      |  7 units |

If:

```text
unit = 200 ms
```

then:

```text
DOT      = 200 ms ON
          200 ms OFF

DASH     = 600 ms ON
          200 ms OFF

CHAR GAP = additional 400 ms
WORD GAP = additional 1200 ms
```

I'd make the **speed configurable** later.

