Don't put everything inside your Compose screen.

Use something like:

```text
app/
├── data/
│   └── MorseDictionary.kt
│
├── domain/
│   └── MorseEncoder.kt
│
├── hardware/
│   └── FlashlightController.kt
│
├── transmitter/
