# 10. Very important: Stop button

Don't overlook this.

Your transmitter should be cancellable.

Use:

```kotlin
private var transmissionJob: Job? = null
```

Start:

```kotlin
transmissionJob = viewModelScope.launch {
    transmitter.transmit(...)
}
```

Stop:

```kotlin
transmissionJob?.cancel()
flashlight.turnOff()
```

And make sure cancellation always turns the flashlight OFF.

This prevents the worst possible bug:

> User presses Stop but the flashlight remains ON.

